      "text": "② Buffer FULL: sender blocks; EMPTY: receiver blocks — goroutines park, OS thread stays free:",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "② Buffer FULL: sender blocks; EMPTY: receiver blocks — goroutines park, OS thread stays free:",
